# Mai, Jaded Edge (1/3, {1}{R}): "Exhaust -- {3}: Put a double strike counter on Mai. (Activate each exhaust ability only once.)" Three Mox
# Rubies pay it exactly on turn 3; she has the counter and double strike (CR 122.1b), and attacking unblocked she deals 1 in
# the first-strike step and 1 in the regular step: Bot2 takes 2 (20 -> 18). On turn 5 it cannot be activated again although
# three mana are there (CR 702.177a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mai, Jaded Edge
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

